From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tangenx <me@tangenx.dev>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 07:08:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 037/128] feat: send inline results without via

via_bot_id is dropped from the outgoing message and from the retry path,
so recipients no longer see which inline bot produced the result. The
result itself carries its content, so it renders as a normal message.
Games and webview results may still need the attribution, which is why
this sits behind a toggle that defaults to off.

Confidence: medium
Scope-risk: moderate
Not-tested: games opened through an inline result
---
